<title>USA: Gables files $500 mln shelf of pfd, debt.</title>
<headline>Gables files $500 mln shelf of pfd, debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gables Residential Trust filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $300 million in preferred shares and up to $200 million of debt securities to be issued by Gables Realty LP.</p>
<p>The Atlanta-based real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale may be used to repay outstanding debt, acquire new properties and for other general corporate needs.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
